{"id":9363369361564,"title":"Beefroll Penny Loafers - Roughman Chocolate","handle":"beefroll-penny-loafers-roughman-chocolate","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Beefroll Penny Loafer is Rancourt \u0026amp; Co.’s most iconic style, rooted in classic New England design and generations of Maine shoemaking. Its signature beefroll detail and timeless profile strike an easy balance between casual and refined, making it a natural choice with denim, chinos, or tailored trousers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted in Roughman Chocolate Leather, the full-grain waxed leather brings rich texture and a naturally rugged character that develops a distinctive patina with wear. An unlined upper allows the leather to soften and mold to the foot, while the leather sole gives the loafer a classic, dress-casual finish.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandsewn using true handsewn moccasin construction and crafted in Maine, USA, continuing a tradition of shoemaking since 1967. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWe recommend ordering a half size down from your normal size. eg. If you normally wear 10D, order 9.5D.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-10-26T17:23:34-04:00","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:23:34-04:00","vendor":"Rancourt \u0026 Co.","type":"Footwear","tags":["Additional Product Colors|beefroll-penny-loafers-british-tan","Additional Product Colors|beefroll-penny-loafers-carolina-brown-chromexcel","Additional Product Colors|beefroll-penny-loafers-natural-chromexcel","Additional Product Colors|beefroll-penny-loafers-roughman-chocolate","Best Sellers","FW26","Last: 114","loafer","loafers","Maine Classics","mocs","Not Sale","Shoes \u0026 Boots"],"price":33800,"price_min":33800,"price_max":33800,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variant